flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5646054Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5646560Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5646773Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5646983Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5647706Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5647875Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5648037Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5648288Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5648396Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5648648Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5648963Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5649282Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5649509Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5649607Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5649730Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5649887Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5650021Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5650254Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5650340Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5650411Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5650517Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5653031Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5653455Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
