flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5660250Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5660392Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5660528Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5660837Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5661233Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5661623Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5661856Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5662034Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5662286Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
