flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5671940Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5672300Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5680593Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:09:58.5680914Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
